{"2651350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slip & Skid", "steam_appid": 2651350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slip &amp; Skid</strong> through countless obstacles placed by your friends in this physic-based multiplayer racing game! <strong>Slip &amp; Skid</strong> combines precision driving and methodical planning to create your path to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>four friends </strong>can compete. It's up to you to alter the track and create the secrets that will make you finish first:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race, then earn points based on your finishing position.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from what the game will offer: a game modifier, an obstacle, a surface change, a trap, etc. Then place it wherever you want.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat until a player reaches the required score. To win, they must <strong>finish first in the next round</strong>. The other players must do everything they can to prevent it: finish before them or team up to destroy them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/02462e6cd664e0cce2c057efc51a10e8.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/02462e6cd664e0cce2c057efc51a10e8.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/02462e6cd664e0cce2c057efc51a10e8.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE EVERY ROUND UNIQUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>It's up to you to decide: ruin your opponents' lives, or make your own easier.</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and place obstacles in between racing rounds, ranging from simple objects to complex animated weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each object can be precisely placed to make it a devastating trap or a narrow shortcut.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/73ecce456f6ee8bd43aa542e70eb99e9.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/73ecce456f6ee8bd43aa542e70eb99e9.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/73ecce456f6ee8bd43aa542e70eb99e9.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet advanced tools for quick and accurate obstacle placement in three dimensions, using a controller or a keyboard and mouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/e3615068d6dd37af5087f811ab1b6e3c.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/e3615068d6dd37af5087f811ab1b6e3c.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/e3615068d6dd37af5087f811ab1b6e3c.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several obstacles allow you to <strong>transform the surface</strong> of the track and objects: asphalt, ice, dirt, mud, concrete, magma, and sand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/6828e2b874218896ac14cd76843f9fa2.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/6828e2b874218896ac14cd76843f9fa2.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/6828e2b874218896ac14cd76843f9fa2.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment, scenery and music change during the game depending on the surfaces that make up the track.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/08c017c3167f53a980395220e2404a92.webp?t=1785935701\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/08c017c3167f53a980395220e2404a92.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" class=\"bb_img\" width=650 height=365 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE FULL SPEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Will you show honor by trusting your driving skills?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerial control allowing flips, rolls, and driving on walls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/3bd16acdb837538be1719dedb0ccf088.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars behave differently depending on the surfaces they drive on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/010e009803d5013388f876d4ccc5695b.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Do you prefer more radical methods?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your friends off the track and into traps with arcade-style, physics-based driving: drifts, accelerations, jumps, flips and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/066b0b3e4bbefcec2bb4590f291b1775.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use obstacles and their various effects to create insane shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/195255a6b284cf40721a8571b928278d.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving altered by various <strong>modifiers</strong>: increasing reverse speed, adding bonuses when doing a flip, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track disrupted by various <strong>modifiers</strong>: swap the start and finish lines, transform all surfaces, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of tracks, many obstacles and modifiers to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle with accessories, designs, and paints that you can unlock throughout the game and in different game modes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/1f49ca34998e305cfc1a336bed017bea.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=650 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/fac3c458a3194127227a6a9ace028153.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game statistics: obstacles placed, and content unlocked. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SINGLE PLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time trial mode with a ghost to beat on each track, unlocking an accessory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITH FRIENDS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Editable rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players online and/or locally in split screen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: There is no matchmaking system. Friend lobbies only.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slip &amp; Skid</strong> through countless obstacles placed by your friends in this physic-based multiplayer racing game! <strong>Slip &amp; Skid</strong> combines precision driving and methodical planning to create your path to victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.poster.avif?t=1785935701\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.webm?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651350/extras/145735f2c71cf43eed9fd5dd3b198ae0.mp4?t=1785935701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>four friends </strong>can compete. It's up to you to alter the track and create the secrets that will make you finish first:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race, then earn points based on your finishing position.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from what the game will offer: a game modifier, an obstacle, a surface change, a trap, etc. Then place it wherever you want.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_parag